            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "No..."
          },
          {
            "id": "l2",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Voss",
            "text": "No, it... it can't be... "
          },
          {
            "id": "l3",
            "speakerId": "mnemosyne",
            "speakerName": "Mnemosyne",
            "text": "Captain, per protocol, you are now in charge of the entire mission."
