            "id": "l4",
            "speakerId": "mnemosyne",
            "speakerName": "Mnemosyne",
            "text": "Captain?"
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791301955120",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "Just..."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791301964157",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "Just give a moment..."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791301994241",
            "speakerId": "mnemosyne",
            "speakerName": "Mnemosyne",
            "text": "Unfortunately, this is an emergency, and therefore, not an appropriate time for a 'moment.' "
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791302013909",
            "speakerId": "mnemosyne",
            "speakerName": "Mnemosyne",
            "text": "Now, shall we review all the possible courses of action available? \n\nI'm ready when you are."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_orest",
        "targetEventId": "node_e0",
        "triggerTiming": "post_action",
        "triggerActionId": "act_e0_1",
        "delayHours": 3,
        "delayUnit": "hours",
        "triggerCondition": "After Investigate Signal",
        "position": {
          "x": 2137,
          "y": 342
        },
        "variationId": "var_v1",
        "category": "KeyChain",
        "floorIndex": 0,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l5",
            "speakerId": "orest",
            "speakerName": "Orest Demchuck",
            "text": "Captain, with all due respect, but it is not too late to turn back and start looking for survivors."
          },
          {
            "id": "l6",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Voss",
            "text": "Believe me, I do not forget about those people. But first, we must retrieve the flight recorder."
          },
          {
            "id": "l7",
            "speakerId": "orest",
            "speakerName": "Orest Demchuck",
            "text": "What good will finding the orange box do?! Why choose an obituary over people's lives?!"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_2b",
        "targetEventId": "node_e2b",
        "triggerTiming": "pre_event",
        "triggerActionId": null,
        "delayHours": 0,
        "delayUnit": "hours",
        "triggerCondition": "ssss",
        "position": {
          "x": 2445,
          "y": 1788
        },
        "variationId": "var_v1",
        "category": "KeyChain",
        "floorIndex": 2,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l8",
            "speakerId": "mnemosyne",
            "speakerName": "Mnemosyne",
            "text": "Captain, we've located the lifeboat within comm link reach."
          },
          {
            "id": "l9",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Voss",
            "text": "Finally... let me speak to them."
          },
          {
            "id": "l10",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Voss",
            "text": "This is Elias Voss, captain of BCEV-07M. Can someone hear me?"
          },
          {
            "id": "l11",
            "speakerId": "survivor",
            "speakerName": "Survivor",
            "text": "Oh, thank goodness... We contracted something on that island. It hurts so much."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_survivor",
        "targetEventId": "node_e2b",
        "triggerTiming": "post_action",
        "triggerActionId": "act_e2b_1",
        "delayHours": 0.5,
        "delayUnit": "hours",
        "triggerCondition": "After Rescue & Quarantine",
        "position": {
          "x": 2741,
          "y": 2288
        },
        "variationId": "var_v1",
        "category": "KeyChain",
        "floorIndex": 2,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l12",
            "speakerId": "khalil",
            "speakerName": "Khalil Arida",
            "text": "The lifepod's log states there was a child on board..."
          },
          {
            "id": "l13",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Voss",
            "text": "I wasn't the only parent back on Zephyrus. It means nothing."
          },
          {
            "id": "l14",
            "speakerId": "survivor",
            "speakerName": "Survivor",
            "text": "Listen... is it true that there is a child with you?"
          },
          {
            "id": "l15",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Voss",
            "text": "Yes, I've got my daughter here."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_rnd",
        "targetEventId": "node_e3b",
        "triggerTiming": "post_action",
        "triggerActionId": "act_e3b_1",
        "delayHours": 0.5,
        "delayUnit": "hours",
        "triggerCondition": "After Medkit Mass Production",
        "position": {
          "x": 2560,
          "y": 3083
        },
        "variationId": "var_v1",
        "category": "KeyChain",
        "floorIndex": 3,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l16",
            "speakerId": "abbadie",
            "speakerName": "Mars Abbadie",
            "text": "That's the thing—it shouldn't have happened! The virus couldn't have bypassed their suits."
          },
          {
            "id": "l17",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Voss",
            "text": "So we're not going to have our brains bleed out of our eyes. That's nice."
          },
          {
            "id": "l18",
            "speakerId": "abbadie",
            "speakerName": "Mars Abbadie",
            "text": "I believe it was a bioweapon."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_engineer",
        "targetEventId": "node_e3a",
        "triggerTiming": "post_action",
        "triggerActionId": "act_e3a_1",
        "delayHours": 0.25,
        "delayUnit": "hours",
        "triggerCondition": "After Leviathan Defeat",
        "position": {
          "x": 1948,
          "y": 3645
        },
        "variationId": "var_v1",
        "category": "KeyChain",
        "floorIndex": 3,
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l19",
            "speakerId": "tuuli",
            "speakerName": "Tuuli Korpela",
            "text": "Captain, we got the orange box! But... it doesn't have anything about the last ten minutes."
          },
          {
            "id": "l20",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Voss",
            "text": "Inside job?"
          },
          {
            "id": "l21",
            "speakerId": "tuuli",
            "speakerName": "Tuuli Korpela",
            "text": "I can't see how an outside force could have paralyzed Zephyrus's entire nervous system."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_1791303674022",
        "targetEventId": "node_e0",
        "triggerTiming": "action_option",
        "triggerActionId": "act_e0_2",
        "delayHours": 0,
        "delayUnit": "hours",
        "triggerCondition": "Mnemosyne suggestion",
        "position": {
          "x": 2179,
          "y": -3
        },
        "variationId": "var_v1",
        "category": "KeyChain",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l_1791303674022",
            "speakerId": "mnemosyne",
            "speakerName": "Mnemosyne",
            "text": "Lifepods are supplied with everything their passengers might need for weeks. The orange box, however, could be hopelessly lost unless we act."
          }
        ],
        "floorIndex": 0
      },
      {
        "id": "diag_1791326756359",
        "targetEventId": "node_e0",
        "triggerTiming": "post_action",
        "triggerActionId": "act_e0_1",
        "delayHours": 3,
        "delayUnit": "hours",
        "triggerCondition": "After Build a transmitter (T1-V1-E1-A0)",
        "position": {
          "x": -45,
          "y": -47
        },
        "variationId": "var_v1",
        "category": "KeyChain",
        "lines": [
          {
            "id": "l_1791326756359",
            "speakerId": "khalil",
            "speakerName": "Khalil Arida",
            "text": "Captain, the transmitter has detected a signal awfully similar to the frequency our escape pods use."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326810336",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "We must check it out then. Add its location to the navigation panel."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326832022",
            "speakerId": "khalil",
            "speakerName": "Khalil Arida",
            "text": "Right away! "
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326875256",
            "speakerId": "khalil",
            "speakerName": "Khalil Arida",
            "text": "And, Captain?"
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326879892",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "What?"
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326893760",
            "speakerId": "khalil",
            "speakerName": "Khalil Arida",
            "text": "I just wanted to say, you know, you shouldn't lose hope just yet."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326900263",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "Stop. That's enough."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326910224",
            "speakerId": "khalil",
            "speakerName": "Khalil Arida",
            "text": "Why? Zephyrus had enough pods for mass evacuation. "
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326928270",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "I'm afraid to get my hopes up..."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791326935957",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "...afraid to feel the heartbreak again..."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791327084814",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "...losing her again and again, each time I open the escape pod and she's not there..."
          },
          {
            "id": "l_1791327095049",
            "speakerId": "voss",
            "speakerName": "Elias Voss",
            "text": "It's easier to accept, just in case."
          }
        ],
        "floorIndex": 0
      }
    ]
  }
}